sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor AD as Backoffice Admin
    participant G as Gateway
    participant A as auth-service
    participant B as RabbitMQ
    participant P as profile-worker
    participant T as text-channel
    actor U as Usuario

    AD->>G: PATCH /api/admin/accounts/42/status
    G->>G: exige role == admin (403 si no)
    G->>A: PATCH /account/42/status<br/>+ X-User-Id del staff
    A->>A: ACTIVE · no revoca sesiones
    A->>B: AccountReactivated<br/>en account_events (fanout)
    B-->>P: fan-out a la cola del worker
    P->>P: el perfil vuelve a servirse<br/>(200 en vez de 404)
    B-->>T: fan-out (lo ignora: solo<br/>escucha AccountSuspended)
    A-->>G: 200 con revoked_session_ids vacío
    G-->>AD: 200 {account_id, status: ACTIVE}
    U->>G: POST /api/login (de nuevo)
    G->>A: POST /login
    A-->>U: access 15 min + refresh:<br/>la cuenta ya está ACTIVE
    U->>G: WS /api/ws/channels/7
